{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "c3cb86a69cfcdafd438c8f886b3ad14ab0ffb58d7b181782de4274cc108310d2", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまですー！\n聞きたいことがあるんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n我有件事想问，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1bde941b0be6233d54817adb808849fc95075fab8c0b5d662d1f1d84433fb966", "ja": "やよい、お疲れさま。\nいいぞ、なんだ？　学校の宿題とかか？", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了。\n当然可以，怎么了？是学校作业之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "bc7ddfb21a83615af712acd7fc4867fb15321d96ee2914d4ce5a0c0d39a3bc0d", "ja": "宿題はもう終わりましたー！　そうじゃなくって、\n{$P$}、ワカサギって好きですか？", "zh": "作业已经做完啦——！不是那个啦，\n{$P$}，你喜欢西太公鱼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a24192be8f32076d0d8b8b83fd81162fcc0a61f20425a4ea1819be66f01558bb", "ja": "ワカサギって、あの魚の？\nどうしたんだ、急に。", "zh": "你说的是那种鱼？\n怎么突然问这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "0cba09f685835c2efe776c466b26a8cb1ce804c55fec66159f9a848e0272fdcb", "ja": "はい！　律子さんと、今度ワカサギ釣りに\n行きたいねーって、話してたんです。", "zh": "是的！我刚才和律子姐聊到，下次想一起去钓公鱼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "3a62916718908aba37db7a29b02d2575ea1248bd3dfa3a6782e0b6a60961f665", "ja": "とれたてのワカサギ、食べ放題ですよー！　でも、\nちょっと遠いから、一緒にきてほしいかなーって……。", "zh": "刚钓上来的公鱼，可以尽情吃哦！不过，因为有点远，所以想请你一起去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7b54083323d03f844a1b7b775cc6917d5e470d8bfbd410da02351c36da14f33c", "ja": "ははあ、なるほど……。\nワカサギで俺を釣ろうって、律子が言ったんだな？", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此……律子是想用公鱼把我钓过去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "a13624995f8a5a75b4306f8adb63f82b845ad9d4129614b65377476a04be1305", "ja": "あ、それは……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊，这个嘛……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1008_p", "source_sha256": "efa8957ac7f098bef90dba114b67100301615f2290ef44f7e840df390e587608", "ja": "わかったよ。オフの日なら、付き合えるから。\nそのかわり、たくさん釣ってくれよ！", "zh": "我知道了。休息日的话，我就可以陪你一起去。\n不过相对地，你可要多钓一点上来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0132_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0132_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "3e9eb75d159c127008b80a5aff0c67aa09f38ffb83ec661a8aaded6bd5e0c0e9", "ja": "本当ですか？　うっうー！　ありがとうございまーす！\nたくさん釣って、ワカサギ祭りしましょうねっ♪", "zh": "真的吗？呜呜——！谢谢您——！\n我们去钓好多好多的西太公鱼，举办西太公鱼祭吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
